#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_LeftTutorIntro"
msgid ""
"Buhahaha!\p"
"You couldn't tell it from looking now,\n"
"but I used to be one tough TRAINER.\p"
"I had a reputation as the toughest\n"
"BEAUTY around, I tell you!\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"What is it now?\n"
"You don't believe me.\p"
"I'm not like that blowhard woman over\n"
"there. I'm actually talented!\p"
"Let me prove it to you.\n"
"I can teach your POKéMON special and\l"
"yet cute moves.\p"
"But my lessons don't come free.\n"
"How about paying for the moves I teach\l"
"with a wee bit of Battle Points?$"
msgstr ""
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"现在你可能看不出来，\n"
"但我以前可是很厉害的训练家。\p"
"我当年可是公认的\n"
"最强大姐姐呢！\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"怎么了？\n"
"你不相信我。\p"
"我可不像那边那个爱吹牛的女人。\n"
"我是真的有本事！\p"
"让我证明给你看吧。\n"
"我可以教你的宝可梦\l"
"既特别又可爱的招式。\p"
"不过我的课可不是免费的。\n"
"教招式的学费，就用一点点\l"
"对战点数来付吧？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:322
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_LeftTutorWelcomeBack"
msgid ""
"Buhahaha!\p"
"Are you back to learn special and\n"
"yet cute POKéMON moves?$"
msgstr ""
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"你是回来学既特别又可爱的\n"
"宝可梦招式的吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:327
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_TeachWhichMove"
msgid ""
"Fine, fine, look here!\n"
"Which move should I teach?$"
msgstr ""
"好啦好啦，你看！\n"
"要我教哪个招式？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:331
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_MoveWillBeXBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"The move {STR_VAR_1}, is it?\n"
"That will be {STR_VAR_2} Battle Points, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"是{STR_VAR_1}吗？\n"
"需要{STR_VAR_2}点对战点数，可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:335
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_TeachMoveToWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Fine, fine, now pick the POKéMON\n"
"I should teach the move to.$"
msgstr ""
"好啦好啦，现在选一只\n"
"要学这个招式的宝可梦吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_HaventGotEnoughPoints"
msgid ""
"What the…\n"
"You haven't got enough Battle Points!$"
msgstr ""
"搞什么……\n"
"你的对战点数不够啊！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:343
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_IllTakeBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"Do you see how skilled I am now?\n"
"I'll take your Battle Points, thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"现在知道我有多厉害了吧？\n"
"对战点数我就收下了，谢啦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:347
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_YouDontWantTo"
msgid ""
"What's that?\n"
"You don't want to…\p"
"If you want to see how skilled I am,\n"
"you come see me anytime!$"
msgstr ""
"怎么了？\n"
"你不想学……\p"
"如果想见识我的本事，\n"
"随时都可以来找我！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_RightTutorIntro"
msgid ""
"Ihihihi!\p"
"I know it's hard to see now, but I used\n"
"to be one fantastic TRAINER.\p"
"I had a reputation as the most\n"
"invincible SWIMMER around, I tell you!\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"What's wrong?\n"
"You don't believe me.\p"
"I'm not like that buffoonish woman over\n"
"there. I'm actually experienced!\p"
"I can prove it to you.\n"
"I can teach your POKéMON hard and\l"
"yet pretty moves.\p"
"But my lessons don't come free.\n"
"How about paying for the moves I teach\l"
"with a wee bit of Battle Points?$"
msgstr ""
"咿嘻嘻嘻！\p"
"现在可能很难看出来，\n"
"但我以前可是了不起的训练家。\p"
"我当年可是公认的\n"
"最无敌的游泳选手呢！\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"怎么啦？\n"
"你不相信我。\p"
"我可不像那边那个滑稽的女人。\n"
"我是真的经验丰富！\p"
"我可以证明给你看。\n"
"我可以教你的宝可梦\l"
"既强硬又漂亮的招式。\p"
"不过我的课可不是免费的。\n"
"教招式的学费，就用一点点\l"
"对战点数来付吧？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:371
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_RightTutorWelcomeBack"
msgid ""
"Ihihihi!\p"
"Have you come to learn hard and\n"
"yet pretty POKéMON moves?$"
msgstr ""
"咿嘻嘻嘻！\p"
"你是来学既强硬又漂亮的\n"
"宝可梦招式的吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:376
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_ThinkLadiesDontGetAlong"
msgid ""
"Those ladies, the way they bad-mouth\n"
"each other, you probably think that\l"
"they don't get along.\p"
"But if that were true, they wouldn't\n"
"stay out here together, would they?$"
msgstr ""
"看那两位女士互相说坏话的样子，\n"
"你大概以为她们合不来吧。\p"
"可如果真是那样，\n"
"她们就不会一起待在这里了吧？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:383
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_LadiesWereStrongAndBeautiful"
msgid ""
"When I was just a wee YOUNGSTER,\n"
"those ladies were strong and beautiful.\p"
"They were idols among us TRAINERS.\p"
"Even now, age hasn't dulled their\n"
"abilities.\p"
"In fact, their POKéMON moves have\n"
"grown even more polished.\p"
"But… For some reason, I can't help\n"
"but feel this…\p"
"Time is so cruel…$"
msgstr ""
"在我还是个小毛头的时候，\n"
"那两位女士又强又漂亮。\p"
"她们是我们训练家心中的偶像。\p"
"就算是现在，\n"
"她们的实力也没有因年龄而衰退。\p"
"事实上，她们的宝可梦招式\n"
"变得更加纯熟了。\p"
"可是……不知为什么，\n"
"我总是忍不住这样想……\p"
"时间真是残酷啊……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:395
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_SoftboiledDesc"
msgid ""
"Recovers up to\n"
"half the user's\n"
"maximum HP.$"
msgstr ""
"回复最多一半的\n"
"最大HP。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:400
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_SeismicTossDesc"
msgid ""
"Inflicts damage\n"
"identical to the\n"
"user's level.$"
msgstr ""
"给予和自己等级\n"
"相同的伤害。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:405
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_DreamEaterDesc"
msgid ""
"Recovers half the\n"
"damage inflicted\n"
"on a sleeping foe.$"
msgstr ""
"攻击睡眠的对手，\n"
"回复一半伤害。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:410
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_MegaPunchDesc"
msgid ""
"A strong punch\n"
"thrown with\n"
"incredible power.$"
msgstr ""
"用不可思议的力量\n"
"打出的强力拳击。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:415
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_MegaKickDesc"
msgid ""
"An extremely\n"
"powerful kick with\n"
"intense force.$"
msgstr ""
"以猛烈的力量\n"
"踢出的强力飞踢。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:420
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_BodySlamDesc"
msgid ""
"A full-body slam\n"
"that may cause\n"
"paralysis.$"
msgstr ""
"全身撞击对手，\n"
"有时会让其麻痹。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:425
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_RockSlideDesc"
msgid ""
"Large boulders\n"
"are hurled. May\n"
"cause flinching.$"
msgstr ""
"投掷巨大的岩石，\n"
"有时会让其畏缩。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:430
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_CounterDesc"
msgid ""
"Retaliates any\n"
"physical hit with\n"
"double the power.$"
msgstr ""
"以2倍的威力\n"
"反击物理攻击。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:435
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_ThunderWaveDesc"
msgid ""
"A weak jolt of\n"
"electricity that\n"
"paralyzes the foe.$"
msgstr ""
"放出微弱电流，\n"
"让对手麻痹。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:440
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_SwordsDanceDesc"
msgid ""
"A fighting dance\n"
"that sharply\n"
"raises ATTACK.$"
msgstr ""
"跳起战斗之舞，\n"
"大幅提高攻击。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:445
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_DefenseCurlDesc"
msgid ""
"Curls up to con-\n"
"ceal weak spots\n"
"and raise DEFENSE.$"
msgstr ""
"缩起身体掩盖弱点\n"
"提高防御。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:450
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_SnoreDesc"
msgid ""
"A loud attack\n"
"that can be used\n"
"only while asleep.$"
msgstr ""
"只能在睡眠时\n"
"使用的吵闹攻击。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:455
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_MudSlapDesc"
msgid ""
"Hurls mud in the\n"
"foe's face to re-\n"
"duce its accuracy.$"
msgstr ""
"向对手脸上泼泥，\n"
"降低其命中率。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:460
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_SwiftDesc"
msgid ""
"Sprays star-\n"
"shaped rays\n"
"that never miss.$"
msgstr ""
"放出星形的光线，\n"
"攻击必定会命中。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:465
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_IcyWindDesc"
msgid ""
"A chilling attack\n"
"that lowers the\n"
"foe's SPEED.$"
msgstr ""
"寒冷的攻击，\n"
"降低对手的速度。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:470
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_EndureDesc"
msgid ""
"Endures any at-\n"
"tack for 1 turn,\n"
"leaving 1HP.$"
msgstr ""
"1回合内撑住攻击\n"
"至少保留1HP。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:475
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_PsychUpDesc"
msgid ""
"Copies the foe's\n"
"effect(s) and\n"
"gives to the user.$"
msgstr ""
"把对手的能力变化\n"
"复制到自己身上。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:480
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_IcePunchDesc"
msgid ""
"An icy punch\n"
"that may\n"
"freeze the foe.$"
msgstr ""
"冰冷的拳击。\n"
"有时会让其冰冻。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:485
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_ThunderPunchDesc"
msgid ""
"An electrified\n"
"punch that may\n"
"paralyze the foe.$"
msgstr ""
"带电的拳击。\n"
"有时会让其麻痹。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:490
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_FirePunchDesc"
msgid ""
"A fiery punch\n"
"that may burn\n"
"the foe.$"
msgstr ""
"火焰的拳击。\n"
"有时会让其灼伤。$"
